# Project Testing

## 1. Introduction
Project testing is performed to verify that the automated standard laptop procurement workflow functions as expected. The testing process focuses on validating the Service Catalog request, approval process, Flow Designer execution, catalog task creation, and assignment to the Hardware team.

## 2. Testing Objectives
- Verify that users can submit standard laptop requests through the Service Catalog.
- Confirm that the Standard Laptop Task flow is associated with the correct catalog item.
- Verify that the workflow creates a catalog task for the requested item.
- Ensure that the task short description and description are populated correctly.
- Confirm that the task is assigned to the Hardware assignment group.
- Verify the generated catalog task through the Requested Item record.

